This <span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This commit closes pull request #6176.">closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="333063689" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/flink/issues/6176" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/flink/pull/6176/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/flink/pull/6176">#6176</a>.

With this change, any project using flink-test-utils which also requires
SecureTestEnvironment must add a dependency to hadoop-minikdc itself, e.g. in
pom.xml:

   ...
   &lt;dependencies&gt;
     &lt;dependency&gt;
       &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.hadoop&lt;/groupId&gt;
       &lt;artifactId&gt;hadoop-minikdc&lt;/artifactId&gt;
       &lt;version&gt;${minikdc.version}&lt;/version&gt;
       &lt;scope&gt;compile&lt;/scope&gt;
     &lt;/dependency&gt;
   ...
   &lt;/dependencies&gt;
   ...

   &lt;build&gt;
     &lt;plugins&gt;
       &lt;!--
         <a href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/DIRSHARED-134" rel="nofollow">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/DIRSHARED-134</a>
         Required to pull the Mini-KDC transitive dependency
       --&gt;
       &lt;plugin&gt;
       &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.felix&lt;/groupId&gt;
       &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-bundle-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;
       &lt;version&gt;3.0.1&lt;/version&gt;
       &lt;inherited&gt;true&lt;/inherited&gt;
       &lt;extensions&gt;true&lt;/extensions&gt;
     &lt;/plugin&gt;
   ...

This <span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This commit closes pull request #3322.">closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="207815660" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/flink/issues/3322" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/flink/pull/3322/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/flink/pull/3322">#3322</a>

